% expect-output: /rangecheck
% expect-output: /rangecheck
% expect-output: /typecheck
% Scenario: a malformed number string. A representation byte outside
% the assigned ones and a string whose length does not match its
% header are rangecheck; a string that does not start with the array's
% type byte is typecheck.
/try { stopped { $error /errorname get == } { (ok) == } ifelse } def
{ [ <95400004 0000 0000 000a 000a> <00> ] ufill } try
{ [ <95200004 0000 0000 000a> <00> ] ufill } try
{ [ <94200004 0000 0000 000a 000a> <00> ] ufill } try
